{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/250304f856950f91c507cb9b8c098ccd.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/250304f856950f91c507cb9b8c098ccd.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/250304f856950f91c507cb9b8c098ccd.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After a cosmic expedition disaster, you are the sole surviving astronaut stranded on Tarvos, an unknown, uncharted moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What initially appears to be a hospitable environment quickly reveals its true, nightmarish nature.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7a4ff871f516a2489ce6954161417cdb.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/65f2c75d97cc43b7e8e109dc75d45653.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/65f2c75d97cc43b7e8e109dc75d45653.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/65f2c75d97cc43b7e8e109dc75d45653.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to survive the hostile surface of Tarvos and uncover secrets that might help you escape. Face hordes of monsters, explore mysterious locations, and find your way to an abandoned laboratory that might hold the answers... and your only chance to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark locations, eerie sounds, and unpredictable threats will draw you into a claustrophobic nightmare on an alien moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/0049ee59df3c17364a20b556a292d282.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7f729f6ffa3fd33bc936abb47690cd92.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7f729f6ffa3fd33bc936abb47690cd92.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7f729f6ffa3fd33bc936abb47690cd92.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of enemies, from small mutants to terrifying beasts that will test your survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/4fb16f8e2023ade1c841ccabf224a2f4.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/25ea42786a8206a67ee1b9ee6c045497.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/25ea42786a8206a67ee1b9ee6c045497.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/25ea42786a8206a67ee1b9ee6c045497.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, upgrade your equipment, and develop skills to meet escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/02d77f136babfa7aa75a56c96e69446b.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did your expedition crash? Was it a mistake, or did someone deliberately condemn you to death? Every step on Tarvos brings you closer to the truth \u2014 the question is, do you have enough time to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3036940?t=1761030131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761030131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/308685c04d22772a33c33479209f683f2b6b8f47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761030131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/308685c04d22772a33c33479209f683f2b6b8f47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761030131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Expect gruesome moments and a horror atmosphere. Jumpscares may appear, along with intense moments of anxiety."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/250304f856950f91c507cb9b8c098ccd.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/250304f856950f91c507cb9b8c098ccd.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/250304f856950f91c507cb9b8c098ccd.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After a cosmic expedition disaster, you are the sole surviving astronaut stranded on Tarvos, an unknown, uncharted moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What initially appears to be a hospitable environment quickly reveals its true, nightmarish nature.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7a4ff871f516a2489ce6954161417cdb.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/65f2c75d97cc43b7e8e109dc75d45653.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/65f2c75d97cc43b7e8e109dc75d45653.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/65f2c75d97cc43b7e8e109dc75d45653.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to survive the hostile surface of Tarvos and uncover secrets that might help you escape. Face hordes of monsters, explore mysterious locations, and find your way to an abandoned laboratory that might hold the answers... and your only chance to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark locations, eerie sounds, and unpredictable threats will draw you into a claustrophobic nightmare on an alien moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/0049ee59df3c17364a20b556a292d282.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7f729f6ffa3fd33bc936abb47690cd92.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7f729f6ffa3fd33bc936abb47690cd92.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/7f729f6ffa3fd33bc936abb47690cd92.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of enemies, from small mutants to terrifying beasts that will test your survival skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/4fb16f8e2023ade1c841ccabf224a2f4.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/25ea42786a8206a67ee1b9ee6c045497.poster.avif?t=1761030131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/25ea42786a8206a67ee1b9ee6c045497.webm?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/25ea42786a8206a67ee1b9ee6c045497.mp4?t=1761030131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, upgrade your equipment, and develop skills to meet escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/extras/02d77f136babfa7aa75a56c96e69446b.avif?t=1761030131\" width=616 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did your expedition crash? Was it a mistake, or did someone deliberately condemn you to death? Every step on Tarvos brings you closer to the truth \u2014 the question is, do you have enough time to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Solverto Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036940/header.jpg?t=1761030131","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3036940/1353677408/8a3c4a4056958ae247a0f75f76322b1e952fa10a/1760371452/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760371975","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3036940/1353677408/8a3c4a4056958ae247a0f75f76322b1e952fa10a/1760371452/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760371975","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3036940/1353677408/8a3c4a4056958ae247a0f75f76322b1e952fa10a/